    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2373,
        "endIndex": 2653,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** Speaking on an *a16z* podcast released October 23, 2026, Amazon CEO Andy Jassy stated that AWS cloud computing capacity for 2026 is fully sold out, 2027 capacity is \"largely sold out,\" and a \"good chunk\" of 2028 is committed due to surging AI compute demand"
